WEBVTT

00:11:27.646 --> 00:11:30.287
He said, "I'm a tap counter."
I'm like, "You're a what?"

00:11:30.311 --> 00:11:32.343
He goes, "Well Jeff Hawkins,
the CEO, says,

00:11:32.367 --> 00:11:36.576
'If any task on the Palm Pilot
takes more than three taps of the stylus,

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.598
it's too long,
and it has to be redesigned.'

00:11:39.622 --> 00:11:40.976
So I'm the tap counter."

00:11:41.414 --> 00:11:43.176
So, I'm going to show you an example

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.822
of a company that does not
have a tap counter.

00:11:45.846 --> 00:11:47.109
(Laughter)

00:11:47.133 --> 00:11:48.704
This is Microsoft Word.

00:11:48.728 --> 00:11:52.862
Ok, when you want to create
a new blank document in Word --

00:11:52.886 --> 00:11:54.038
it could happen.

00:11:54.062 --> 00:11:59.410
(Laughter)

00:11:59.434 --> 00:12:02.893
You go up to the "File" menu
and you choose "New."